## Scope Contract 3: Design System Compliance Verification

**Objective**: Ensure all components in critical path use design system tokens.

**Files to Audit/Fix**:
- `app/(store)/products/SidebarClient.tsx` - Fix hardcoded colors
- `app/components/layout/catalogue/details/DetailSection.tsx` - Verify tokens
- `app/components/features/products/ProductsGrid.tsx` - Verify tokens

**DoD - Layer 1 (Structure)**:
- [ ] No hardcoded hex colors in any component
- [ ] All colors use `brand`, `secondary`, `accent`, `surface`, `text` scales
- [ ] All typography uses `text-h4`, `text-body` etc.

**DoD - Layer 2 (Layout)**:
- [ ] Spacing uses Tailwind spacing scale (not arbitrary values)
- [ ] Responsive breakpoints use defined screens (`xs`, `sm`, `lg-desktop`)
- [ ] No arbitrary pixel values in className

**DoD - Layer 3 (Surface)**:
- [ ] Hover states use `hover:` modifiers with design tokens
- [ ] Transitions use standard durations (150ms, 200ms, 300ms)
- [ ] Shadows use defined boxShadow tokens

**DoD - Layer 4 (Interaction)**:
- [ ] Focus states use `focus-visible:` for accessibility
- [ ] Active states use `active:` modifiers
- [ ] Reduced motion respected with `motion-safe:`

**Verification (Testing)**:
- [ ] Script: `npm run lint:tailwind` passes
- [ ] Visual regression: Screenshot comparison at 1280px, 768px, 375px
- [ ] Manual check: No hardcoded colors in inspected elements

---

